<title>LATVIA: Latvian unemployment unchanged 7.1 in August.</title>
<headline>Latvian unemployment unchanged 7.1 in August.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unemployment in Latvia was running at 7.1 percent in August, unchanged from the previous month's figure, the statistics committee said on Monday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     Aug '96     July '96     Aug '95</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)   7.1	   7.1	    6.1</p>
<p> Number of unemployed     89,300	89,900	 77,637</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
